    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21090" root="سهم" body-key="s">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استهموا</span></b>  (S, Msb) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تساهموا</span></b>  (S) <i>They
cast,</i> or <i>drew, lots,</i> or <i>practised sortilege,</i> [or
<i>sortilege with arrows,</i>] <i>one with another;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقترعوا</span> (S, Msb) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تقارعوا</span>, (S,) both of which
signify the same. (S &amp;c. in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قرع</span>.)

